  sold around $10 million to $20 million during the morning. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , which by law must buy most of the dollars earned by\par state-owned oil monopoly Petroleos de Venezuela SA (PDVSA), is the\par biggest supplier of dollars to the market.\par    -By Greg Cancelada; 582-564-3291\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires  11-02-98\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1603GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1155 1864 \par \par \uc2 Dokument em00000020010917du2b0020e\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
