\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Venezuela \highlight\uc2  Bolivar Ends Dn Despite Central Bk  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 192 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 Januar 1998\par 22:22\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  CARACAS (Dow Jones)--The bolivar closed weaker against the dollar Thursday as rock-bottom interest rates and weak international oil prices continued to put pressure on the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , traders said. \par \par \uc2  The dollar closed at a midrate of 505.50 bolivars, up from Wednesday's close of 505.00 bolivars. \par \par \uc2  The average bank spread was 505.00/506.00. Spreads of major banks ranged from 505.00/506.00 to 505.50/506.50. \par \par \uc2  The bolivar would have closed the day even weaker had the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Venezuela\b0 \highlight\uc2  not aggressively \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market to bring support to the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Traders estimated that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  unloaded around $120 million in the course of the day. \par \par \uc2  'The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold frantically. To (my bank) alone, it sold over $17 million,' a trader at one major bank said. \par \par \uc2  According to traders' estimates, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has sold around $300 million over the last three days to bring support to the bolivar. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  doesn't comment on its actions in the market. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 08-01-98 \par \par \uc2  2122GMT \par \par \uc2  1155 1864 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du18006g4\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\pi