\par\par \b \uc2  Venezuela Overnight Rate Soars Higher; Liquidity Tightens \b0\par\par\uc2 319 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 August 1997\par 00:39\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par n/bon\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par CARACAS (AP-Dow Jones)--The lending rate on Venezuela's overnight,\par interbank market soared higher Tuesday as liquidity in the financial\par system tightened, traders said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  The overnight rate closed in a range of 35%-40%, up from Monday's close of 20% and Friday's close of 4%-5%. \par \par \uc2  Traders said that the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Venezuela\b0 \highlight\uc2 's aggressive \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market last week, which was carried out to prevent the bolivar from sliding sharply against the dollar, drained sizeable amounts of liquidity from the financial system. \par \par \uc2  'It's really the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's dollar-selling last week that has got the system so tight right now,' one trader said. \par \par \uc2  Traders estimated that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  unloaded around $230 million between last Wednesday and Friday --  significantly more than what the bank, which by law must buy nearly all of the dollars earned by the state oil monopoly PdVSA, sells normally. \par \par \uc2  Meanwhile, the credit tightening in the system Tuesday combined with the market expectations of a further tightening next week when the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  raises the reserve requirement also pushed yields on \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  TEM bills higher in the weekly primary auction. \par \par \uc2  The benchmark six-month TEM bills yielded 22.67%, up 1.27 percentage points from last week. \par \par \uc2  The nine-month bills yielded 24.49%, up 0.80 percentage point, and the 12-month bills yielded 25.70%, up 0.82 percentage point. \par \par \uc2  Meanwhile, in slow secondary market trading after the auction, the yield on the six-month bills was quoted at between 22.50% and 22.75%, mostly unchanged from the primary auction yield. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  announced Monday that on Aug. 11 it is raising the reserve requirement to 17% from a current 15% in an effort to combat swelling liquidity levels in the financial system. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 05-08-97 \par \par \uc2  2239GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt8505nm9\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
