\par\par \b \uc2  Venezuela bolivar ends weaker at 492.00/493.00/dlr. \b0\par\par\uc2 226 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 Juli 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  CARACAS, July 16 (Reuter) - The Venezuelan bolivar closed weaker at 492.00/493.00 per dollar Wednesday as interest rates dropped and the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  did not respond to heavy \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  demand, traders said. \par \par \uc2  The bolivar closed at 490.00/490.75 Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  Yields on the benchmark six month TEM bills fell by 88 basis points to 19.54 percent, bringing their drop nearly four percentage points in the last month. \par \par \uc2  The drop in interest yields spurred on already strong dollar demand, traders said. \par \par \uc2  "The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  very little, it only met corporate demand," one trader said. \par \par \uc2  Traders said the bolivar could continue to slip if the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  did not respond to the high \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  demand in coming days. \par \par \uc2  Venezuela's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market is unusual in that the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is its largest single supplier of dollars, which blurs the difference between the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  supplying liquidity and \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Venezuela\b0 \highlight\uc2  continues to pursue an inflation-fighting strong bolivar policy, where the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  ostensibly floats between slowly depreciating bands set by \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Critics say the policy has left the bolivar increasingly over-valued with the exchange rate little-changed since price and \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  controls were removed in April last year. \par \par \uc2  ((--Ana Isabel Martinez, Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600)) \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt7g02lum\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
