\par\par \b \uc2  Venezuela bolivar ends weaker at 490.00/490.75/dlr. \b0\par\par\uc2 204 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Juli 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  CARACAS, July 15 (Reuter) - The Venezuelan bolivar closed weaker at 490.00/490.75 per dollar Tuesday as banks continued to buy back \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  positions sold in response to the increase in the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's reserve requirement, traders said. \par \par \uc2  The bolivar closed at 489.25/490.25 Friday. \par \par \uc2  Traders said that banks had turned to the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market when they realized the increase in the reserve requirement from 12 to 15 percent had done little to effect market liquidity levels. \par \par \uc2  Traders said the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was attentive to dollar demand and managed to prevent the bolivar from slipping further. \par \par \uc2  Venezuela's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market is unusual in that the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is its largest single supplier of dollars, which blurs the difference between the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  supplying liquidity and \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Venezuela\b0 \highlight\uc2  continues to pursue an inflation-fighting strong bolivar policy, where the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  ostensibly floats between slowly depreciating bands set by \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Critics say the policy has left the bolivar increasingly over-valued with the exchange rate little-changed since price and \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  controls were removed in April last year. \par \par \uc2  ((--Silene Ramirez, Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600)) \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt7f02jpk\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
