\par\par \b \uc2  Venezuelan bolivar closes weaker at 487.00/488.00. \b0\par\par\uc2 188 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 Juli 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  CARACAS, July 2 (Reuter) - The Venezuelan bolivar closed slightly weaker at 487.00/488.00 per dollar Tuesday, as the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  met strong foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  demand, traders said. \par \par \uc2  The bolivar closed at 486.75/487.75 Monday. \par \par \uc2  "There was foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  demand, especially from banks, but the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  came in strongly to maintain the exchange rate," one broker said. \par \par \uc2  Traders said trading levels were higher than in recent sessions but the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was clearly not prepared to allow the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  slide. \par \par \uc2  Venezuela's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market is unusual in that the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is its largest single supplier of dollars, which blurs the difference between the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  supplying liquidity and \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Venezuela\b0 \highlight\uc2  continues to pursue an inflation-fighting strong bolivar policy, where the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  ostensibly floats between slowly depreciating bands set by \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Critics say the policy has left the bolivar increasingly over-valued with the exchange rate little-changed since price and \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  controls were removed in April last year. \par \par \uc2  ((--Silene Ramirez, Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600)) \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt71036h5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
