\par\par \b \uc2  Venezuela bolivar ends softer at 485.75/486.75/dlr. \b0\par\par\uc2 204 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 Juni 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  CARACAS, June 27 (Reuter) - The Venezuelan bolivar closed weaker at 485.75/486.75 per dollar Friday as the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  allowed \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  demand to push up the exchange rate, traders said. \par \par \uc2  The bolivar closed at 484.75/485.75 Thursday. \par \par \uc2  Traders said that although demand for foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  had not increased significantly, the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had not met demand for dollars. \par \par \uc2  "The rate went up because the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was not there," one said. \par \par \uc2  Traders said the exchange rate's behavior next week would depend largely on the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's decision on whether or not to meet demand. \par \par \uc2  Venezuela's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market is unusual in that the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is its largest single supplier of dollars, which blurs the difference between the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  supplying liquidity and \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Venezuela\b0 \highlight\uc2  continues to pursue an inflation-fighting strong bolivar policy, where the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  ostensibly floats between slowly depreciating bands set by \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Critics say the policy has left the bolivar increasingly over-valued with the exchange rate little-changed since price and \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  controls were removed in April last year. \par \par \uc2  ((--Silene Ramirez, Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600)) \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt6r03arw\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
