\par\par \b \uc2  Venezuela bolivar ends soft as dlr demand returns. \b0\par\par\uc2 206 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 Juni 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  CARACAS, June 26 (Reuter) - The Venezuelan bolivar closed slightly weaker at 484.75/485.75 per dollar Thursday as demand for foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  picked up following several days of dollar sales on strong capital inflows, traders said. \par \par \uc2  The bolivar closed at 484.50/485.50 Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  Traders said the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  met dollar demand in the morning but a late rush for \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  by large banks at the end of the afternoon pushed the rate up slightly. \par \par \uc2  Despite the late buying, traders said they expected the rate to remain little changed Friday with the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  having comfortable reserves to meet current demand. \par \par \uc2  Venezuela's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market is unusual in that the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is its largest single supplier of dollars, which blurs the difference between the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  supplying liquidity and \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Venezuela\b0 \highlight\uc2  continues to pursue an inflation-fighting strong bolivar policy, where the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  ostensibly floats between slowly depreciating bands set by \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Critics say the policy has left the bolivar increasingly over-valued with the exchange rate little-changed since price and \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  controls were removed in April last year. \par \par \uc2  ((-- Ana Isabel Martinez, Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600)) \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt6q03cox\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
