\par\par \b \uc2  Venezuela bolivar ends soft as dlr demand returns. \b0\par\par\uc2 228 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 Mai 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  CARACAS, May 22 (Reuter) - The Venezuelan bolivar closed slightly weaker at 483.75/484.75 per dollar Thursday as demand for foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  picked up following several days of dollar sales in an illiquid market, traders said. \par \par \uc2  The bolivar closed at 483.25/484.25 Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  "The market was fairly busy. There were two or three big banks buying dollars," one trader said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  most of the market's demand, avoiding a sharp rise in the exchange rate, traders said. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  demand had been weaker earlier in the weak as money market dried up and overnight interbank lending rates rocketed. Overnight rates have now returned to near normal levels, traders said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate was expected to remain little hanged Friday, they added. \par \par \uc2  Venezuela's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market is unusual in that the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is its largest single supplier of dollars, which blurs the difference between the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  supplying liquidity and \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Venezuela\b0 \highlight\uc2  continues to pursue an inflation-fighting strong bolivar policy, where the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  ostensibly floats between slowly depreciating bands set by \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Critics say the policy has left the bolivar increasingly over-valued with the exchange rate little-changed since price and \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  controls were removed in April last year. \par \par \uc2  ((-- Ana Isabel Martinez, Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600)) \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt5m05b76\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
