\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Venezuela forex intervention \highlight\uc2  has topped $50 mln/wk. \b0\par\par\uc2 230 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 Juni 1996\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1996 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  CARACAS, June 28 (Reuter) - Venezuelan \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market has risen from some $15 million per week to more than $50 million recently, \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  President Antonio Casas Gonzalez said. \par \par \uc2  "Yes it has exceeded $50 million, but that's a rough figure," Casas told reporters at an oil conference. \par \par \uc2  In the first six weeks since exchange controls were removed on April 22, daily \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  averaged $3 million, Casas said, "but since then it has been more". \par \par \uc2  The bolivar continues to trade within a tight 460 to 472 bolivar per dollar range, but increasing numbers of local economists believe the bolivar may be overvalued. \par \par \uc2  Support of an overvalued \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  would warrant increased \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , they say. \par \par \uc2  "We have a responsibility to participate in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market," said Casas, who reiterated plans to introduce a \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  bands system, hopefully by August. \par \par \uc2  However, other Venezuelan Agenda polices -- such as a banking sector fund and a recently delayed sales tax hike -- would have to be firmly in place first, Casas said. \par \par \uc2  In the meantime, "we have informally used reference (trading points)", Casas added. \par \par \uc2  The formal bands system would be publicly announced once established and then adjusted according to the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's primary goal, "which is to reduce inflation", Casas said. \par \par \uc2  -- Caracas newsroom, 582 834405 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1996 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011018ds6s05zsx\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
