\par\par \b \uc2  Venezuela Shares Drift Down In Light Early Trade \b0\par\par\uc2 277 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 Juni 1996\par 16:53\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par CARACAS (AP-Dow Jones)--Venezuela share prices crawled downward in\par paper-thin early trade Friday ahead of a long weekend, traders said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Around 1415 GMT, 30 minutes into the session, the Merinvest Composite\par Index was at 215.08, down 0.22 percentage points, or 0.1%.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  Benchmark Electricidad de Caracas was changing hands at 396.00, down 2.50 bolivars from Thursday's close. \par \par \uc2  Trading volume is expected to remain light Friday as investors head out of the office early with Monday being a bank holiday that will keep the market closed. \par \par \uc2  The market should gain mildly Friday, traders said. \par \par \uc2  While the drop in interest rates is pushing some local investors into equities, foreign investors remain cautious about sinking their money into the local bourse, preventing a strong market rally from developing. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Venezuela\b0 \highlight\uc2 's heavy \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market Wednesday and Thursday is worrying investors that the bank may try to maintain an overvalued exchange rate, and in so doing burn foreign reserves. \par \par \uc2  'Concern is arising among foreign investors that the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's operating reserves are dangerously low,' one trader said. \par \par \uc2  If reserves drop too much, the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  may give up defending the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and let it sharply depreciate, they said. That would make it more expensive for foreigners to move their money out of the country. \par \par \uc2  The Cenrtral Bank's reserves stood at $9.939 billion on May 24. It doesn't release operating reserve figures. \par \par \uc2  The Merinvest closed Thursday at 215.30, up 2.19 points, or 1.0%. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 07-06-96 \par \par \uc2  1453GMT \par \par \uc2  5052 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011013ds6704pbo\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
