\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Venezuela \highlight\uc2 's Petkoff/Timetable -3: No  \highlight22\uc2 Forex Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 200 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 Mai 1996\par 23:37\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  'I must say that these two issues are going forward like clockwork. All the previous stages, all that there is to do, all the logistics of this process are going ahead, I would say, with celerity and with the projected dates,' Petkoff said. \par \par \uc2  Continuing with the planned sales, Petkoff said the Deposit Guarantee and Bank Protection Fund (Fogade), is planning to privatize Banco Tequendama in either July or August, Banco de Venezuela in the next six months, and Banco Consolidado in August or September. As well, Fogade is hoping to sell Nuevo Mundo, an insurance company, in June, as well as other small insurers in September and October, Petkoff said. \par \par \uc2  Touching on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, which re-opened April 22 after being closed for 22 months, Petkoff said the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Venezuela\b0 \highlight\uc2  had not yet \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to prop up the value of the bolivar against the dollar. \par \par \uc2  'In fact, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  hasn't had to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 ,' Petkoff said. \par \par \uc2  Various \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  traders, however, claim the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  through at least one of \b \highlight22\uc2 Venezuela\b0 \highlight\uc2 's state-owned commercial banks. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 06-05-96 \par \par \uc2  2137GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011013ds5603s4p\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
