, Stearns & Co. in New York. But she doesn't think the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  will drop to its nadir by week's end. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 22-04-96 \par \par \uc2  0354GMT \par \par \uc2  1199 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011013ds4n03e9n\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
